{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mouse is your LIFE \u2013 swing it without shame!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Forward</i>, a 3D side-scrolling hell where &quot;physics engine&quot; becomes &quot;physics torture&quot;! Ditch the keyboard; your mouse is the only savior (or killer). <strong>DRAG and WHIP</strong> that floppy (or rigid?) hero body with the cursor through brutal 3D stages \u2013 squirm, climb, launch, wrestle! One tiny mistake may send you spiraling to heaven, free-falling, or stuck in absurd corners questioning life. Excruciatingly brutal with bizarre deaths, yet your clumsy struggles might trigger explosive laughter or philosophical silence... <strong>Reach the end BY ANY MEANS! ROLL, MOUSE HERO!</strong> The ecstasy of victory will redeem all &quot;agony&quot;.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879730?t=1755544887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879730/e757f066c58eb27a0d0aa30f6b7b144afaa8450f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755544887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879730/b1ef72b1f067ba7def3cc25576ba117e69620fda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755544887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879730/b1ef72b1f067ba7def3cc25576ba117e69620fda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755544887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mouse is your LIFE \u2013 swing it without shame!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Forward</i>, a 3D side-scrolling hell where &quot;physics engine&quot; becomes &quot;physics torture&quot;! Ditch the keyboard; your mouse is the only savior (or killer). <strong>DRAG and WHIP</strong> that floppy (or rigid?) hero body with the c